# Hybrid Monitor LUT
# Profile  : Nikon N-Log
# Cameras  : Z6, Z7, Z6II, Z7II, Z8, Z9
# Input    : Nikon N-Log log / N-Gamut
# Output   : Rec.709 base + narrow exposure tracer overlays
# Generator: hybrid_monitor_lut.py
#
# Base transform pipeline:
#   Log decode  →  N-Gamut → Rec.709 matrix  →  Rec.709 OETF
#
# Overlay zones (thin tracers over Rec.709 base):
#   #ef4444     white_clip      log 0.720 – 1.000
#   #eab308     +2 stops        log 0.550 – 0.564
#   #d946ef     +1 stops        log 0.448 – 0.462
#   #22c55e     +0 stops        log 0.358 – 0.369
#   #06b6d4     -1 stops        log 0.288 – 0.297
#   #3b82f6     -2 stops        log 0.235 – 0.241
#   #6366f1     black_clip      log 0.000 – 0.130
#   All other levels → standard Rec.709 color (no tracer)
#
TITLE "HybridMonitor Nikon N-Log"
LUT_3D_SIZE 33
DOMAIN_MIN 0.0 0.0 0.0
DOMAIN_MAX 1.0 1.0 1.0

